# Name: Gothic Starwork
# Summary: Nested stars, decagons, and onion-dome forms create intricate Gothic tracery.
# Visualizer: turtle_2d
# Angle: 36
# Iterations: 2
# Max Iterations: 4
# Initial Color: 2
# Heading: 0
# Draw: X
# Move: Y
#
# Morph-friendly carrier rewrite of the imported Gothic.Outline preset. The
# original represents every drawn carrier as `F X` and every moving carrier as
# `G Y`, then deletes F and G at the next rewrite. Fusing each pair into its
# X/Y carrier preserves the exact turtle geometry while retaining visible
# parentage across adjacent generations.

axiom X Plus Plus X Plus Plus X Plus Plus X Plus Plus X Plus Plus;

match X then X Plus Plus X [ Plus Plus Y ] Minus X [ Plus Plus Y [ Plus Plus Y ] Minus X Plus Plus X ] Minus X [ Plus Plus Y Minus Minus Y ] Minus X [ Plus Plus Y ] Minus X Plus Plus X;
match Y then Y Plus Plus X [ Plus Plus Y ] Minus X [ Plus Plus Y [ Plus Plus Y ] Minus X Plus Plus X ] Minus X [ Plus Plus Y Minus Minus Y ] Minus X [ Plus Plus Y ] Minus X Plus Plus Y;
